GFOpenTorrent: the database without Windows' shell.
The migrations' SQL functions get_known_folder_path and
get_user_default_ui_language answer through compat/gfot_db.cpp: the
download drawer from Environment (given to the function as its SQLite
user data) and a fixed language id (the language comes from locale_name).
The database file name is the path's own string. Each change sits under
__WXOPENLAYOUT__, Windows' code as it was. Migrate() reads the migrations
from the table tools/stove/gen-migrations.sh writes from resources.rc,
in place of EnumResourceNames.
